{"seq":3,"slug":"position-encoding-taxonomy","title":"位置编码谱系：从正弦到 RoPE 的一张地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rotary-embeddings/foundations/position-encoding-taxonomy","wordCount":1355,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"位置编码谱系-从正弦到-rope-的一张地图\">位置编码谱系：从正弦到 RoPE 的一张地图</h1><p>如果把过去七年提出的位置编码方法全摊在桌面上，会显得杂乱无章：正弦、可学习、Shaw 相对、Transformer-XL、T5 桶偏置、ALiBi、RoPE、CoPE……但只要抓住两个坐标轴——&quot;绝对还是相对&quot;&quot;加性还是乘性&quot;——它们立刻各就各位，而 RoPE 会显现为这张地图上一个自然的收敛点。这一篇不深推任何一种方法的数学（RoPE 的推导在 <a href=\"../mechanism/rotation-matrix\">旋转矩阵与复数视角</a>），只做横向定位与对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两个坐标轴切出的四个象限\">核心概念：两个坐标轴切出的四个象限</h2><p>第一个轴问：编码的是 token 的<strong>绝对坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></strong>，还是两个 token 的<strong>相对距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m-n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></strong>？第二个轴问：位置信息是<strong>加</strong>到表示上（加性，与语义在同一通道相混），还是以<strong>乘/变换</strong>的方式作用（乘性，通常只在注意力打分处生效、不改语义模长）？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R[位置编码方法] --&gt; AB{绝对 or 相对}&#10;  AB --&gt;|绝对| ABS[正弦编码&lt;br/&gt;可学习绝对编码]&#10;  AB --&gt;|相对| REL{加性 or 乘性}&#10;  REL --&gt;|加性偏置| ADD[Shaw 相对&lt;br/&gt;T5 桶偏置&lt;br/&gt;ALiBi 线性惩罚]&#10;  REL --&gt;|乘性旋转| ROT[RoPE&lt;br/&gt;旋转 Q/K]&#10;  ABS --&gt; NOTE1[长度受限&lt;br/&gt;语义纠缠]&#10;  ADD --&gt; NOTE2[需额外偏置/参数&lt;br/&gt;内核融合较难]&#10;  ROT --&gt; NOTE3[零参数·内积只依赖 m-n&lt;br/&gt;可外推]\">flowchart TD\n  R[位置编码方法] --&gt; AB{绝对 or 相对}\n  AB --&gt;|绝对| ABS[正弦编码&lt;br/&gt;可学习绝对编码]\n  AB --&gt;|相对| REL{加性 or 乘性}\n  REL --&gt;|加性偏置| ADD[Shaw 相对&lt;br/&gt;T5 桶偏置&lt;br/&gt;ALiBi 线性惩罚]\n  REL --&gt;|乘性旋转| ROT[RoPE&lt;br/&gt;旋转 Q/K]\n  ABS --&gt; NOTE1[长度受限&lt;br/&gt;语义纠缠]\n  ADD --&gt; NOTE2[需额外偏置/参数&lt;br/&gt;内核融合较难]\n  ROT --&gt; NOTE3[零参数·内积只依赖 m-n&lt;br/&gt;可外推]</pre><p>RoPE 的独特之处在于它落在&quot;相对 × 乘性&quot;这个几乎没人占据过的象限：既拿到相对性，又用乘性变换避开了加性方法的参数与融合难题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"绝对系-正弦与可学习\">绝对系：正弦与可学习</h2><p><strong>正弦位置编码</strong>（Vaswani 等，2017）用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>10000</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PE_{(m,2i)}=\\sin(m/10000^{2i/d})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\">/1000</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>10000</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PE_{(m,2i+1)}=\\cos(m/10000^{2i/d})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\">/1000</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 给每个绝对位置生成一个固定向量，再加到词向量上。它无需训练、理论上可外推到任意长度，但外推质量差，且如上一篇 <a href=\"position-encoding-problem\">位置编码之痛</a> 所述，位置与语义在加法里纠缠。<strong>可学习绝对编码</strong>（BERT、GPT-2）把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 当参数学，效果稍好但有硬性长度天花板——超过训练最大长度就没有对应向量。</p>\n<p>一个有趣的历史巧合：正弦编码里出现的多频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin/\\cos</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span></span></span></span></span> 结构，与 RoPE 里的多频率旋转在&quot;每个维度以不同波长变化&quot;这一点上神似，但作用方式截然不同——一个加、一个旋转。别被表面的三角函数骗了，这一点在 <a href=\"why-rope\">为何 RoPE</a> 已经强调过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相对加性系-shaw-t5-alibi\">相对加性系：Shaw、T5、ALiBi</h2><p>这一族的共同思路是往注意力 logits 里加一个与相对距离有关的项。<strong>Shaw 相对编码</strong>给每对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(m,n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 学一个相对位置向量并注入打分与取值；<strong>Transformer-XL</strong> 用相对编码支持片段级循环，处理更长上下文；<strong>T5</strong> 把相对距离分成对数间隔的桶，每个桶学一个标量偏置直接加到 logits。<strong>ALiBi</strong>（Press 等，2022）最简约：不学任何东西，给 logits 减去一个正比于距离的惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\lambda|m-n|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，天然带远程衰减，外推性出奇地好，因此在一些强调长度泛化的模型里仍被采用。</p>\n<p>加性相对方法的共同短板是与高效注意力内核（尤其 FlashAttention）的融合更麻烦，且表达能力受限于&quot;给不同距离一个标量或向量偏置&quot;，无法像旋转那样对每个特征维度施加有结构的、频率各异的相对变换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rope-相对性做进乘法里\">RoPE：相对性做进乘法里</h2><p>RoPE 把第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 位的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>、第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 位的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 各自旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，打分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle R_m q, R_n k\\rangle = q^\\top R_{n-m} k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0574em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 只剩相对量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>。它不加任何参数、不改注意力公式形状、不动向量模长，相对性纯粹来自旋转矩阵的正交群性质 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_m^\\top R_n = R_{n-m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（严格证明见 <a href=\"../mechanism/relative-property\">相对位置性质</a>）。同时它对每个维度对施加不同旋转频率（<a href=\"../mechanism/frequency-bands\">频率带与波长</a>），表达能力远超单一标量偏置，还能通过调频率实现外推（<a href=\"../extrapolation/\">外推章</a>）。</p>\n<p>下面把六类方法放进同一张对比表，一眼看清 RoPE 为何成为 2026 年的默认选择。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>象限</th>\n<th>额外参数</th>\n<th>外推</th>\n<th>远程衰减</th>\n<th>内核友好</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正弦</td>\n<td>绝对·加性</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>原始 Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可学习绝对</td>\n<td>绝对·加性</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>无（硬上限）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>BERT / GPT-2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shaw 相对</td>\n<td>相对·加性</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可学</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>Music Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T5 偏置</td>\n<td>相对·加性</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可学</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>T5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALiBi</td>\n<td>相对·加性</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>BLOOM / MPT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>RoPE</strong></td>\n<td><strong>相对·乘性</strong></td>\n<td><strong>无</strong></td>\n<td><strong>好（可缩放）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>有</strong></td>\n<td><strong>好</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Llama/Qwen/Mistral</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"谱系仍在生长\">谱系仍在生长</h2><p>位置编码并未因 RoPE 一统而停止演化。2024 年后出现了 CoPE（上下文相关位置编码，让&quot;位置&quot;由内容而非计数决定）、以及各种把 RoPE 与相对偏置混合的方案；多模态领域则衍生出二维、多段的 RoPE 变体（见 <a href=\"../practice/rope-variants\">变体：2D 与多模态</a>）。这些新工作大多把 RoPE 当作基座去改造，而非推翻它——这本身就说明了 RoPE 在这张地图上的中心地位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>用&quot;绝对/相对 × 加性/乘性&quot;两轴，可把所有位置编码方法整齐归位。</li>\n<li>绝对加性（正弦、可学习）简单但外推差、语义纠缠；相对加性（Shaw、T5、ALiBi）抓住距离但融合难、表达受限。</li>\n<li>RoPE 独占&quot;相对 × 乘性&quot;象限：零参数、内积只依赖相对距离、内核友好、可外推。</li>\n<li>一张六方法对比表显示 RoPE 在几乎所有维度上取得最优折中，故成 2026 年默认。</li>\n<li>谱系仍在生长（CoPE、多模态变体），但多以 RoPE 为基座。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>进入数学主场：<a href=\"../mechanism/rotation-matrix\">旋转矩阵与复数视角</a></li>\n<li>相对性的严格证明：<a href=\"../mechanism/relative-property\">相对位置性质</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：ALiBi 等如何服务长度泛化见 <a href=\"../../long-context-llm-techniques/\">长上下文技术</a>；注意力打分机制见 <a href=\"../../efficient-attention-mechanisms/\">高效注意力机制</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"位置编码谱系：从正弦到 RoPE 的一张地图","id":"位置编码谱系-从正弦到-rope-的一张地图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两个坐标轴切出的四个象限","id":"核心概念-两个坐标轴切出的四个象限"},{"level":2,"text":"绝对系：正弦与可学习","id":"绝对系-正弦与可学习"},{"level":2,"text":"相对加性系：Shaw、T5、ALiBi","id":"相对加性系-shaw-t5-alibi"},{"level":2,"text":"RoPE：相对性做进乘法里","id":"rope-相对性做进乘法里"},{"level":2,"text":"谱系仍在生长","id":"谱系仍在生长"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"位置编码之痛：注意力为何看不见词序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rotary-embeddings/foundations/position-encoding-problem"},"next":{"title":"旋转矩阵与复数视角：RoPE 的数学构造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rotary-embeddings/mechanism/rotation-matrix"}}